{
  "title": "Oily Dense Saudi Arabian Chestnut Mushroom Bowl",
  "description": "A fresh and dense post-workout dish from Saudi Arabia featuring chestnut mushrooms, shio-cure, and served in a lacquerware bowl, perfect for a quick and nutritious meal after exercise, with no onions or garlic",
