  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat",
    "Add the sliced chestnut mushrooms and cook until they are tender and lightly browned",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the shio-cure, salt, and black pepper",
    "Sprinkle the shio-cure mixture over the cooked mushrooms and stir to combine",
    "Squeeze the lemon juice over the mushrooms and stir again",
    "Transfer the mushroom mixture to the lacquerware bowl",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy"
